created: 2025-02-10, last updated: 2026-04-16, [Read more](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues/26296)

The extension API currently provides no way to access transaction state or receive transaction completion events.
...
We currently use the following to make sure that any operations performed in an extension are done using the same transaction if one is active:
...
// Very hacky way to get the current transaction
// if one exists, while maintaining typing
function getContext(params) {
if (params.scope?.parentParams) {
return getContext(params.scope?.parentParams);
}
const transaction = (params as any).__internalParams.transaction;
const context = transaction
? (prisma as any)._createItxClient(transaction)
: prisma;
return context as ExtendedPrisma;
}
```
